DetourModKit vendored SafetyHook backend delta (upstream base f44cc07 -> reviewed tree).
Carries four DMK corrections that exist on no upstream ref:
  1. report trap transaction failures        (fork fix/trap-transaction-status, 45b1060 == refs/pull/135/head)
  2. allow teardown after TrapManager's static destruction (follow-up 99e6888, on no remote)
  3. make enabled state follow committed or witness-reconciled ownership, retain explicit patch provenance,
     and expose address-scoped reported-failure and exception test seams
  4. rescue a DEP fault raised inside a protection window that closed before the fault reached the handler,
     which otherwise escapes unhandled and kills the host
Applying this to the pinned base reproduces the reviewed backend tree byte for byte.
